---
import ProseLayout from '../../layouts/ProseLayout.astro';
import { getBrand, site } from '../../config/site';
import { toolsFor } from '../../tools/registry';
const brand = getBrand('en');
---

<ProseLayout
  locale="en"
  title="About"
  description={`${brand.name} is a free collection of online tools by ${site.author}. Every tool runs locally in your browser.`}
  path="/about/"
>
  <p>
    {brand.name} is a free online toolbox maintained by {site.author}. The English edition currently offers {toolsFor('en').length}
    tools, and more are added regularly. The site started in Taiwan as 隨手 (pronounced “suí-shǒu”, roughly “at hand”), and the
    name sums up the idea: the tool you need should simply be there when you reach for it.
  </p>
  <h2>Why this site exists</h2>
  <p>
    Most of the time you just want to check a number or convert a format, yet you end up installing an app or pasting your data
    into a site you know nothing about. Every tool here aims to open instantly, stay out of your way, give the right answer, and
    explain how that answer was worked out.
  </p>
  <h2>Your data stays on your device</h2>
  <p>
    All tools run with standard browser features (JavaScript, Canvas, Web Crypto). The text you type and the files you pick are
    processed on your own device and are never sent to our servers.
  </p>
  <h2>Why it’s free</h2>
  <p>
    The site is supported by Google AdSense advertising, which pays for hosting and development. We place ads so that they don’t
    get in the way of the tools themselves.
  </p>
  <h2>Get in touch</h2>
  <p>Found a bug or have an idea for a new tool? Let us know on the <a href="/en/contact/">contact page</a>.</p>
</ProseLayout>
